{"schema_version":"1.0","issue_id":"SP-2023-Y","package_id":"generative-media","draft_version":"v0.1","status":"DRAFT","headline":"生成メディアが、独立した製品・モデルスタックになった","deck":"2023年の画像・動画生成では、単発の研究デモだけでなく、open model、API、会話UI、既存制作ソフトへの統合という複数の公開形態が並んだ。DALL-E 3、SDXL/Turbo、Stable Video Diffusion、Adobe Firefly/Generative Fillを通じて、生成メディアが独立した技術・製品層へ分岐した過程を追う。","deck_attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","deck_evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-openai-dalle3-2023-684566cd34","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-sdxl-2023-13b70ad671","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-stable-video-2023-82e8633f6a","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-adobe-firefly-2023-d29228b355","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"}],"blocks":[{"block_id":"multiple-surfaces","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"生成メディアの進歩は「新しい画像モデルが出た」という一列の出来事ではない。DALL-E 3は会話型製品との接続、SDXL系はmodel releaseと高速化、Stable Video Diffusionは動画生成、Fireflyは既存クリエイティブツールとの統合という異なるsurfaceを持つ。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-openai-dalle3-2023-684566cd34","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-sdxl-2023-13b70ad671","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-stable-video-2023-82e8633f6a","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-adobe-firefly-2023-d29228b355","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"}]},{"block_id":"release-vs-integration","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"研究・モデル公開、API提供、製品機能への統合は区別すべきである。ユーザーが利用できる生成機能の価値はmodel qualityだけでなく、prompt作成支援、編集workflow、配布形態、既存アプリケーションとの接続によっても変わる。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-openai-dalle3-2023-684566cd34","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-sdxl-2023-13b70ad671","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-adobe-firefly-2023-d29228b355","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"}]},{"block_id":"image-video","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"画像生成と動画生成も同じ成熟度として扱えない。Stable Video Diffusionの登場は、画像で進んだ生成モデルの公開・利用パターンが動画へ拡張され始めたことを示すが、対象となる出力、計算量、評価方法、製品化の境界は異なる。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-stable-video-2023-82e8633f6a","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-sdxl-2023-13b70ad671","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"}]},{"block_id":"speed-workflow","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"SDXL Turboのような高速化方向やGenerative Fillのような編集統合は、生成品質だけでなくiteration timeとworkflowへの組み込みが競争軸になることを示した。生成モデルは単体アプリではなく、制作工程の一部として評価され始めた。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-sdxl-2023-13b70ad671","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-adobe-firefly-2023-d29228b355","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"}]},{"block_id":"media-boundary","block_type":"CLAIM_BOUNDARY","text":"画質、速度、創造性、安全性などの比較値は、各vendor/project/authorの条件に依存する。本稿はrelease形態と技術方向を整理し、異なる評価条件を独立した共通ランキングへ換算しない。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2023-Y:series-openai-dalle3-2023-684566cd34","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"}]}],"must_cover_coverage":[{"requirement":"research/model release versus product integration/API availability","block_ids":["release-vs-integration"]},{"requirement":"image versus video generation boundaries","block_ids":["image-video"]},{"requirement":"vendor/author performance claims remain attributed","block_ids":["media-boundary"]}],"boundary_coverage":[{"requirement":"Primary-source verification establishes the bounded facts recorded here; it does not convert vendor, project, or author evaluations into independent reproduction.","block_ids":["media-boundary"]}],"late_breaking_acknowledged":false}